s within 72 hours of reserved date & time are charged in full, and considered non-refundable. No-shows are charged in full, and considered non-refundable. All Alcatraz packages are non-refundable once booked. Please refer to your Alcatraz confirmation for confirmation/cancellation details. \n\n**Changed Reservation Date Policy:**\n\n• If a reservation date is changed from its original date, the changed reservation disqualifies the above cancellation policy. The changed reservation date is charged in full, is considered non-refundable, and is charged in full.\n\n**Reservation Terms & Conditions:**\n\n• Reservation is valid for redemption for bikes/equipment/tours noted on this invoice receipt. It is not transferable, has no cash value, and may be redeemed only once.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Starting at $55 | All Ages | Includes bike rental bonus", "short_description": "Guided sunset bike ride from San Francisco piers across the Golden Gate Bridge with coastal views and historic stops.", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/CaJRm8kOQnGCdorqC5W9", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/CaJRm8kOQnGCdorqC5W9", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/10201/images/536897/", "pk": 536897, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/e6I1JKJmQW2lgOBrNFuT", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/e6I1JKJmQW2lgOBrNFuT", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/10201/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/e6I1JKJmQW2lgOBrNFuT", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/e6I1JKJmQW2lgOBrNFuT", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/10201/images/536898/", "pk": 536898, "unicode": "ph